            "review_text": "Cornelis V\nBrisbane, Australia3 contributions\n0\nA NGON MEANS SOMETHING DELICIOUS\nSep 2026 • Couples\nThe name means SOMETHING DELICIOUS. The restaurant came highly recommended and lived up to the great reputation. The menu offers local Vietnamese foods as well as Western flavoured items. The dishes are hearty and delicious with reasonable prices for generous portions. Alcohol is available if desired.\nThe staff are very friendly, attentive and speak English well.\nOn entering the restaurant we could see that it was spotlessly clean in front of house. The rear was just as immaculate.\nWe enjoyed our experience so much that we came several evenings. We totally enjoyed ourselves each time.\nThe restaurant is located in Hoi An close to resorts and hotels. \nWe will come again and we can highly recommend the staff and food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 25, 2026",
