            "review_title": "Review at Angon Hoi An Restaurant-Local food & Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "tabibito1979\nGeneva, Switzerland7 contributions\n0\nGood food but disappointing speed of service\nAug 2026 • Family\nNice food but very slow service and flat atmosphere meant we were a little disappointed. We ordered dinner for a family of four and waited a very long time for food and drinks - and for one dish in particular which meant the others went cold while we waited. A simple improvement would be to serve drinks straight away, which would make a long wait for food in busy periods more tolerable. The food was good when it came though.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 19, 2026\nGlobal29927696601\nDear Tabibito1979, \nThank you for your honest feedback. We are very sorry that the slow service affected your family's dinner with us. especially that one dish arrived much later than the others. \nWe also appreciate your suggestion about serving drinks promptly. We have taken your feedback seriously and have since improved the way we coordinate drinks and dishes during busy periods. \nWe are glad to know that you enjoyed the food, and we trully appreciate your feedback as it has helped us improve our service.\nWarm regards,\nAngon Hoi An Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
