            "review_text": "Alana P\n1 contribution\n0\nMust visit neighbourhood eatery\nJul 2026 • Couples\nExcellent in every way. Generous portions, varied menu, brilliant prices. Loved the crispy spring rolls and white rose dumplings. Tender beef and comforting chicken & turmeric noodle broth. The avocado shake was the cherry on top. The owner and staff were super attentive. Can't wait to go back. This was only a couple of minutes walk from our hotel Ancient Riverside Retreat.\nRead more\nWritten July 9, 2026\nGlobal29927696601\nDear alanap935,\nThank you so much for your wonderful review. We delighted to know that you enjoyed your meal, especially the crispy Spring rools, White rose dumplings, Chicken & turmeric noodle broth, and Avocado shake.\nYour kind words about our food, valued and service mean alot to our team. We hope you had a wonderful time in Hoi An and took home many happy memories from your trip.\nWarm regards,\nAngon Hoi An Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
