            "review_text": "Stine F\n7 contributions\n0\nGreat place\nJul 2026 • Family\nFantastic experience. Nice service, delicious and beautifully furnished food. The sweetest owners. Great restaurant \nWe will definitely be back before we leave from Hoi An. Great recommendation.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Danish\nShow original\nWritten July 8, 2026\nGlobal29927696601\nDear 521stinef,\nThank you so much for your lovely review and kind words. We're delighted that you enjoyed the food, its presentation, the service and the atsmosphere at our restaurant. \nIt was a pleasure having you with us, and we trully appreciate your recommendation. We hope you left Hoi An with many wonderful memories.\nWarm regards,\nAngon Hoi An Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
