            "review_text": "Paula\nAuckland, New Zealand14 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely Delicious\nMay 2026 • Family\nMy two granddaughters and I came upon this restaurant and the food was so delicious, that we went back the following evening and had the same meal again, Creamy Garlic Butter Prawns. Absolutely stunning. The flavours were incredible. Vi our waitress was so lovely and friendly. Thank you Vi. Cảm ơn\nWritten May 7, 2026\nGlobal29927696601\nDear Cruiser29262247510,\nThank you so much for your wonderful review. It meant alot to us that you and your granddaughter enjoyed the Creamy Garlic Butter Prawns so much that you came back to have them again the following eveving!\nWe're also very happy to hear your kind words about Vi. We trully appreciate you chossing to dine with us twice during you time in Hoi An. And we hope you took home many lovely memorries from your trip.\nWarm regards,\nAngon Hoi An Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
