            "review_text": "Chrissie S\nFrance21 contributions\n0\nA quality restaurant with great menu\nApr 2026 • Couples\nThis is a lovely restaurant. Spacious and well-lit inyide and a couple of tables at the front. Excellent menu with vegetairan and gluten free options. Staff members speak good English Portions are generous and well- presented. Unusually, this restaurant serves good wines by the glass and these (like the food) are reasonably priced. The restaurant is just outside the Old Town and easily reached.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe inside dining area is light bright and spacious with good a/c. There are two tables outside for those who enjoy watching the world go by\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 27, 2026\nGlobal29927696601\nDear 825chrissies,\nThank you very much for such a thoughtful review. We're delighted that you enjoyed not only our food but also the atsmosphere, service and variety of our menu.\nWe especially appreciate you mentioning our vegetarian and gluten-free options, as well as your wine selection. Your kind words mean agreat deal to our team.\nWe hope you left Hoi An with many happy memories.\nWarm regards,\nAngon Hoi An Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
